Subject: [PATCH 30/31] Stall incident 2026-09-28: run_pack.py heartbeat clock
 starts at each attempt; a pod-wide stall (>= half the live arms, >= 2) is
 POD_STALL, stopped together and not charged to per-arm retries (separate
 budget, relaunch only with the arm's RSS free in the cgroup); POD_MEM (cgroup
 memory.current/max/free, pressure, per-arm group RSS) every poll; exit 5 (RSS
 gate) not retried; CPU tests

